==German==

===Etymology===
The misspelling is likely due to the fact that ''Fotze'' is an offensive word and is thus not often found in published works. The spelling has also been used deliberately by some (as an eye-dialect form), because the shape of the letter V is reminiscent of a [[mons Venus]], and because the words {{m|de|Vulva}} and {{m|de|Vagina}} are also spelt with an initial V.

